<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>It had been a while since I'd come to the area around the station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The cherry blossoms were in pretty bloom here too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no sign of <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> at the meeting spot yet.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"No </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> yet, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, are we okay on time?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"We leave in 15 minutes. If we miss this one, we'll get to Arata way later..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> of all people wouldn't be late, though..."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s phone rang.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're still not here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The caller seemed to be <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s loud voice carried over to me too.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Bad_Luck.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I'm so sorry! I was spacing out, and then it was this late...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I'll be there in 20 minutes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey now, then you won't make the train..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Go on without me! I entrust the rest to you...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... what should we do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Let's wait for her... It can't be helped if we're late."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Be grateful to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Archangel Natsumi-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> says she'll wait for </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Waaah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpaaai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! I, the genius girl Erina Goto, will follow you for the rest of my life!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Quit talking nonsense and get over here already! If you don't make the next train, we won't get to Arata today!"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Geez..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> being late because she was spacing out is rare, right? Did something happen...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, we'll give </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> a nice long interrogation about that when she gets here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> flashed a slightly creepy smile.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
